    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a representative of the gods, the player embarks on a journey to reclaim the power by fighting against beings that run wild with the power of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/1665a3652171dc8760ae72c49d1700d0.avif?t=1734543086\" width=200 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soul-like game where you defeat enemies using parrying, rolling, and guarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.poster.avif?t=1734543086\" width=200 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.webm?t=1734543086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.mp4?t=1734543086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the Harmagedon game tutorial part, which consists of one monster and one boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Upcoming features and content]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Additional regular monsters and boss monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various types of armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level-up system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weapons other than swords and shields (magic, greatswords, bows, etc.)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a representative of the gods, the player embarks on a journey to reclaim the power by fighting against beings that run wild with the power of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/1665a3652171dc8760ae72c49d1700d0.avif?t=1734543086\" width=200 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soul-like game where you defeat enemies using parrying, rolling, and guarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.poster.avif?t=1734543086\" width=200 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.webm?t=1734543086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161990/extras/5792030cf7f4480f6fbccc9e090e8a86.mp4?t=1734543086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the Harmagedon game tutorial part, which consists of one monster and one boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Upcoming features and content]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Additional regular monsters and boss monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various types of armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level-up system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weapons other than swords and shields (magic, greatswords, bows, etc.)</p></li></ul>",
